QingQi for Edu is adapted from ZCode (https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode).

ZCode source files, copyright headers, the Apache License 2.0, and third-party
notices are retained. Education-specific additions and modifications are under
education/ and specs/education/, with limited public exports and UI adaptations
in the upstream packages. See education/source.json and education/docs/reuse.md
for the source revision and reuse boundaries.

The distributed demo questions and student profile are authored synthetic data.
Private student records, credentials, original datasets, and model weights are
not included in this source distribution.
